@local/dsh-deepseek-girl README · Pro 娘的冬日衣柜：<p align="center"><a href="https://github.com/nailiang002-wq/deepseek-girl-harness/releases/latest/download/DeepSeekGirl-Harness.zip"><strong>⬇ 下载最新版插件（ZIP）</strong></a> · <a href="#三步安装">三步安装</a> · <a href="https://github.com/nailiang002-wq/deepseek-girl-harness/issues">反馈问题 / 提建议</a></p>

**适用于 DeepSeek Harness Desktop，已在 Windows 验证。** 非官方角色插件；角色显示在 Harness 窗口内。使用预编译安装包无需 Node.js，互动和动画无需额外模型调用。

首页动图使用实际插件界面、模拟模型选择与虚构任务；先前互动演示中的账本也使用虚构数据。下方转轮与安装窗口图来自 Harness 实机。

@local/dsh-deepseek-girl README · 切换模型，就能看见变身：v1.10 使用 Harness 的模型选择服务，在 Windows、应用内 SDK **0.2.1-rc.2** 环境实测。旧版若缺少模型选择服务，请先升级 Harness。完整互动演示仍可查看 [转轮、摸头与白饭](docs/images/quick-tour.gif)。

<p align="center"><img src="docs/images/feeding-pro.gif" width="600" alt="Pro 形态戴着铁盆帽连续吃三口白饭，完整人物帧统一对齐"></p>

除了变身，她还会陪你完成日常任务：捧盆求饭、摸头鼓脸、戴铁盆帽、手写时间问候、紧凑互动转轮，以及摸头后短暂显示的余额和今日用量。Flash 的五套服装继续保留，每套都有完整互动。

@local/dsh-deepseek-girl README · 今天穿哪一套：**冬日新装：** 奶油蓝羽绒服搭配蓝色针织围巾；月牙绒绒斗篷搭配奶油色高领毛衣、绒毛镶边和金色月牙扣。两套各自配齐十二种状态，也能戴铁盆帽和连续吃三口白饭。

从角色菜单选择 **打开小衣柜**，点选衣服试穿，再点 **就穿这套** 保存。取消、按 Escape 或点击衣柜外面，会恢复已经保存的衣服。选中的衣服卡片也会同步展示当前动作，方便在小窗口中预览。

五套衣服都支持思考、回答、吃饭、摸头、鼓脸、拖动和休息等全部状态。换衣服会接着播放当前动作，保留正在进行的任务、吃饭进度、铁盆帽和位置。吃白饭现在会连续完成三次舀饭入口，不再只吃一口就结束。

@local/dsh-deepseek-girl README · 她的饭钱小账本：**摸摸头，给你看看今天的小账本。** 平时不显示；轻点头部后，余额、今日预估费用和 Token 小卡片出现约 10 秒。鼠标移到卡片上或用键盘聚焦时保持显示，方便慢慢看；点卡片展开明细。也可以从 **更多 → 小账本** 主动打开。

**更多 → 小设置 → 摸头账本** 可关闭这项互动。仅在卡片或详情打开时查询；持续查看时约每分钟刷新一次，关闭后停止。金额保存在内存中，本地只记住功能开关。

**图片使用虚构示例数据，不是实际账户余额。**

@local/dsh-deepseek-girl README · DeepSeek Girl · Harness Desktop：**Switch to Pro and watch Little Whale transform. Switch back to Flash to welcome her back in her saved outfit.**

English · [中文](README.md) · **v1.11.2**

**v1.11.2 fixes a display issue on DSH 0.2.2-rc.1.** In conversations with messages, Little Whale could slide to the bottom of the window and appear partly cut off. She now stays within the window, including after resizing. Replace the plugin files and reopen Harness to apply the update.

@local/dsh-deepseek-girl README · Change the model, watch her transform：1. **Water and light gather**: a pale blue glow surrounds her as water rings and droplets rise. A handwritten caption announces the change.
2. **The new form appears**: Little Whale fades out and the long-haired whale maid emerges through the water effect, with blue hair and pale tips, a curved ahoge, a whale tail, a white whale-emblem apron, and a navy dress.
3. **She returns to your task**: the glow clears and she follows thinking, answering, completion, and the other task states. Her body stays steady while her tail sways gently. Feeding uses complete character drawings for three consecutive bites.

@local/dsh-deepseek-girl README · Install in three steps：1. **Download and extract** the ZIP above; find the `DshDeepSeekGirl` folder.
2. In Harness, open **Plugins → Add plugin** (choose **Install third-party plugin** if a dropdown appears). Paste the full path of the `DshDeepSeekGirl` folder containing `package.json` into **Package name or address**.
3. **Install and enable** the plugin, then reload when prompted. If your version has no reload option, quit and reopen Harness.
